classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ — Phase 1 draft UML (before implementation)

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +int age
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
    }

    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
        +sort_by_time() list~Task~
        +get_todays_schedule() list~Task~
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : needs
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads tasks from
